                        "form": "гуверна́нтках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ca36144-6669-302f-9fb1-3bc624e8fd86",
                        "entry_id": "fce68030-b43c-3e55-bfcb-a7d795573aab",
                        "glosses": [
                            "воспитательница в буржуазных семьях, нанимаемая для воспитания и начального обучения детей"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "620f83d8-ae79-40d4-899e-67bc9c2ce422",
                                "sense_id": "5ca36144-6669-302f-9fb1-3bc624e8fd86",
                                "text": "Жена узнала, что муж был в связи с бывшею в их доме француженкою-гувернанткой, и объявила мужу, что не может жить с ним в одном доме."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "99beb2ac-c72f-43ed-ada1-3333e3b313fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "fce68030-b43c-3e55-bfcb-a7d795573aab",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ca36144-6669-302f-9fb1-3bc624e8fd86",
                        "target_lang_word": "governess",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "governess",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ab23645-5ff3-3e19-87b1-0523bff278c7",
                                        "entry_id": "0d154f6c-0a21-3384-886d-aed729aa6437",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woman paid to educate children in their own home."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cf69263-903a-4b53-b8fd-ac8afbde2035",
                                                "sense_id": "4ab23645-5ff3-3e19-87b1-0523bff278c7",
                                                "text": "[Mashenka Pavletsky] returning from a walk to the house of the Kushkins, with whom she was living as a governess, found the household in a terrible turmoil."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7a07997-06e4-451e-ad11-1c119dfdd318",
                                                "sense_id": "4ab23645-5ff3-3e19-87b1-0523bff278c7",
                                                "text": "Boy, you are a crabby lady! Who are you? Calvin's cruel governess?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6035d187-659f-48c1-b01d-a7866de1266c",
                                                "sense_id": "4ab23645-5ff3-3e19-87b1-0523bff278c7",
                                                "text": "it was then still just possible to have a relatively normal life at the family’s 25-bedroom mansion at 145 Piccadilly, from where the baby was taken for a two-hour constitutional in her pram to Hyde Park and back every day by her governess."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00474347-7eee-355c-91d4-df56d8eff137",
                                        "entry_id": "0d154f6c-0a21-3384-886d-aed729aa6437",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female governor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6b90218-d374-4071-b50c-d70f4d6874ce",
                                                "sense_id": "00474347-7eee-355c-91d4-df56d8eff137",
                                                "text": "I cannot begin to tell you how tired I am of this woman and all she stands for and all those shallow people who think an Alaskan governess has what it takes to be a VP."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "668fe4ad-a7ca-43a9-92a8-3b68e2911985",
                                                "sense_id": "00474347-7eee-355c-91d4-df56d8eff137",
                                                "text": "“The Gates Ajar” seems to be the favorite song and inspiration of Ma Ferguson in her four years as governor. The lady governess pardoned criminals as soon as they were convicted and was so chronic in her actions that the courts had just about refused to function in convicting anyone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "514e8a44-3555-3fdf-a3ff-66f4df83466d",
                                        "entry_id": "0d154f6c-0a21-3384-886d-aed729aa6437",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The wife of a governor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9461e722-2bcb-4bca-8278-8089ef0d9913",
                                                "sense_id": "514e8a44-3555-3fdf-a3ff-66f4df83466d",
                                                "text": "The Lady Governeſs of the Town drew near to me; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f9ff8ac-d601-4497-9a18-801a660a17d4",
                                                "sense_id": "514e8a44-3555-3fdf-a3ff-66f4df83466d",
                                                "text": "The common wood strawberry, which was introduced by the Right Hon. Lady Powis [Henrietta Clive, Countess of Powis] when Governess at Madras, grows in great luxuriance and of delightful flavour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d089425-0ebe-407a-a1d5-aeba2d168296",
                                                "sense_id": "514e8a44-3555-3fdf-a3ff-66f4df83466d",
                                                "text": "I was pressed to make a halt at Ahmedabad for a few days; then asked to stay for a few hours; finally, for half an hour, to see “the Governor and Governess” of Madras."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "governess",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f20c6656-181e-3c97-a843-b89160828e19",
                                        "entry_id": "bb05acef-a5f2-3ebe-a543-8237b9b47d07",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To work as governess; to educate children in their own home."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29de3389-bd6a-43b9-9a53-27cf809bef65",
                        "source_entry_id": "fce68030-b43c-3e55-bfcb-a7d795573aab",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ca36144-6669-302f-9fb1-3bc624e8fd86",
                        "target_lang_word": "Gouvernante",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Gouvernante",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f94e325-9683-3c3f-a0e6-c2773c78e34f",
                                        "entry_id": "a75a9b65-d85f-3136-b1f2-eec3c0b2aef7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hauslehrerin, Erzieherin (als Angestellte einer Familie)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6790a8a5-cf42-487e-b2f4-d7542c9e7825",
                                                "sense_id": "9f94e325-9683-3c3f-a0e6-c2773c78e34f",
                                                "text": "Ungefähr zwanzig Jahre später fuhr ich nach Lausanne, um eine alte Schweizerin ausfindig zu machen, die erst Sebastians und dann meine Gouvernante gewesen war."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce9bbbed-ac20-4bea-9a07-1a1ef6a6e92c",
                                                "sense_id": "9f94e325-9683-3c3f-a0e6-c2773c78e34f",
                                                "text": "„Es bereitete mir Vergnügen, zu sehen, daß meine Gouvernante ganz anders beschaffen war als ich.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2d7d80e-92a8-4830-a897-42c8127be948",
                                                "sense_id": "9f94e325-9683-3c3f-a0e6-c2773c78e34f",
                                                "text": "„Die dreiundzwanzigjährige Ida Melos wohnte wie Freiligrath erst seit Herbst des vorangegangenen Jahres am Rhein und arbeitete als Gouvernante im Hause eines Offiziers.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d03d0e2-fa17-47ac-9801-5da0dae8d3ac",
                                                "sense_id": "9f94e325-9683-3c3f-a0e6-c2773c78e34f",
                                                "text": "„Als ich meine Laufbahn als Erzieherin begann, war ich fast noch ein Kind, und einer Gouvernante bieten sich nicht viele Gelegenheiten, Unfug zu treiben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e647b9b6-85bf-4bba-8c9d-10ba38154635",
                                                "sense_id": "9f94e325-9683-3c3f-a0e6-c2773c78e34f",
                                                "text": "„Darüber freute sie sich, war froh, endlich aufgeholt zu haben, obwohl sie nur bei der Gouvernante lernte und nicht wie Otto in der Schule.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14de4f96-ab7d-30b6-8dc3-13d3fa488faa",
                                        "entry_id": "a75a9b65-d85f-3136-b1f2-eec3c0b2aef7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "altjüngferlich oder tantenhaft wirkende Frau; meist bevormundend und tugendhaft belehrend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ironisch"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "896800d4-d4a2-41b4-ac97-3595db2efe6d",
                                                "sense_id": "14de4f96-ab7d-30b6-8dc3-13d3fa488faa",
                                                "text": "Mit ihren ständigen Ermahnungen zur Tugendhaftigkeit und ihrem keuschen Auftreten benahm sie sich wie eine Gouvernante."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6b41c6cd-a2fc-415e-ae3d-23ed4ae439df",
                        "source_entry_id": "fce68030-b43c-3e55-bfcb-a7d795573aab",
                        "source_sense_id": "5ca36144-6669-302f-9fb1-3bc624e8fd86",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hauslehrerin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hauslehrerin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2aa771d6-a639-3d9d-bbd9-1988d0e4ff38",
                                        "entry_id": "1427a843-463c-362c-930b-4056b85e6ad8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lehrerin, die Schüler zuhause unterrichtet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9441e9a1-3c34-4dc2-ade6-a6537a3d9187",
                                                "sense_id": "2aa771d6-a639-3d9d-bbd9-1988d0e4ff38",
                                                "text": "Unsere Hauslehrerin brachte uns das Lesen und Schreiben bei."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
